//@version=6
//
// OUR CODE: one leak-free lookahead_on sub-program (close[1] on 4 h) — the containing-bar probe
// (impl-08 T10, A2 / CAR-04-1).
strategy("htf lookahead (strategy-pine T10)", overlay = true)
p = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "240", close[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
plot(p)
if close > p
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
